  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sky-villages-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">正在尋找 <strong>Fabric</strong> 版本？點擊這裡！</a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wFQMVmz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"446\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?color=blueviolet&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=blueviolet&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"187\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/y3z0n\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=LunaPixelStudios&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"172\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?color=blue&amp;label=Follow&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"127\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sky-villages-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FABRIC-Version-black?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"137\" height=\"26\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">沒錯！就是在雲端之地的村莊！探索天空中美麗壯觀的村莊吧！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這些村莊會在你的世界中完全隨機生成，每個天空城鎮都將擁有獨特且與眾不同的外觀！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組目前持續穩定開發中。每次更新都會加入新的村莊/內容。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>相容性資料包</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">資料包讓你能以特定方式修改此模組。所有內容皆可調整與設定。相容性資料包會將其他模組的方塊、物品和生物加入此模組。要將它們加入你的模組包，請安裝 Global Packs 模組，並將它們放入你的資源包資料夾。此外，你也可以使用 Paxi 或 Open Loader 來確保它們在世界建立時被載入。如果你使用的是 Curseforge 啟動器，請考慮將相容性資料包放入資源包資料夾，以便 Curseforge 正確辨識。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目前可供使用的官方相容性資料包（截至 v1.0.4）：</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-waystones-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">傳送石碑 x 天空村莊</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-graveyard-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">墓園 x 天空村莊</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-supplementaries-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">補充配件 x 天空村莊</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-farmers-delight-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫樂事 x 天空村莊</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-bakery-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">一起做烘焙 x 天空村莊</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-vinery-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">一起做葡萄酒莊 x 天空村莊</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-candlelight-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">一起做燭光 x 天空村莊</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-beachparty-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">一起做海灘派對 x 天空村莊</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-brewery-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">一起做釀造 x 天空村莊</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-herbal-brews-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">一起做草本茶 x 天空村莊</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h5><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.bisecthosting.com/LunaPixel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/x8xufcE.png\" width=\"1076\" height=\"170\"></strong></a></h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>圖片</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s47MBTf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KzcpaYS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aRlKszu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G4BOAHE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EmGry5c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/We7fyp4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"></strong></span></p>",
